<title>CHINA: China February soy products import, export totals.</title>
<headline>China February soy products import, export totals.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's imports and exports of</p>
<p>soybean, soymeal and soyoil as reported in official customs</p>
<p>figures (percentage change is for Jan-Feb 1997 compared with</p>
<p>same period of last year):</p>
<p>		   FEBRUARY	  JAN-FEB IMPORTS	VS PVS YEAR</p>
<p> Soybean	345,754	    746,546		  N/A PERCENT</p>
<p> Soyoil	   34,461	    202,656		  - 20</p>
<p> Soymeal	 332,178	    701,602		 N/A</p>
<p>(Note: all figures in tonnes)</p>
<p>		   FEBRUARY	  JAN-FEB EXPORTS	VS PVS YEAR</p>
<p> Soybean	  20,103	     25,412		 N/A PERCENT</p>
<p> Soyoil		489		  641		  + 210</p>
<p> Soymeal		60		1,360		 N/A</p>
<p>(Note: all figures in tonnes)</p>
</text>
